Mjollnir-wielding skeleton that got generated in Orcus-Town. No exciting 
conducts; I'm still just working on cutting back on the conducts I do 
break. I genocided fewer monsters this time (7 types) than in any 
previous ascension. I also made more use of spells than before, 
